les des ├®tudiants de l\'UMONS'),(673,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_10_paragraphename','field_69c72efc6a921'),(674,42,'Builder_0_subsection_11_text','Retrouvez toutes les capsules par ici :┬á<a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/user-418293061\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://soundcloud.com/user-418293061</a>'),(675,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_11_text','field_69c4d54bbf536'),(676,42,'Builder_0_subsection_11_persotext','0'),(677,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_11_persotext','field_69c4d8e087a6b'),(678,42,'Builder_0_subsection_11_ignorespacing','0'),(679,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_11_ignorespacing','field_69cbeb348ce06'),(680,42,'Builder_0_subsection_12_paragraphename','Le cycle d\'ateliers'),(681,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_12_paragraphename','field_69c72efc6a921'),(682,42,'Builder_0_subsection_13_text','En partenariat avec┬á<a href=\"https://www.actionmediasjeunes.be/\">Action M├®dia Jeunes</a>, nous vous proposons de vivre une animation en groupe ! Et si on cr├®ait un complot pour apprendre ├á d├®tricoter les autres?\r\n\r\nApr├¿s avoir d├®crypt├® les codes et m├®canismes ├á lÔÇÖ┼ôuvre dans les th├®ories du complot, il est temps de les d├®tourner dans une production parodique. Des dates qui lient myst├®rieusement lÔÇÖ├®lection de Donald Trump et le lancement de Fortnite ├á lÔÇÖ├®trange co├»ncidence entre les initiales dÔÇÖArchibald Haddock et celles dÔÇÖAdolf Hitler, qui arrivera ├á mettre sur pied la th├®orie du complot la plus loufoque┬á?\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">D├ëTAILS PRATIQUES</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Dur├®e : 1 heure 30 minutes ├á 3 heures</li>\r\n 	<li>Nombre : de 5 ├á 15 jeunes</li>\r\n 	<li>Age : 15-25 ans</li>\r\n 	<li>Prix : Gratuit dans le cadre du projet On nÔÇÖa que lÔÇÖinfo quÔÇÖon se donne</li>\r\n 	<li>Infos et r├®servation? info@mundaneum.be</li>\r\n</ul>'),(683,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_13_text','field_69c4d54bbf536'),(684,42,'Builder_0_subsection_13_persotext','0'),(685,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_13_persotext','field_69c4d8e087a6b'),(686,42,'Builder_0_subsection_13_ignorespacing','0'),(687,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_13_ignorespacing','field_69cbeb348ce06'),(688,42,'Builder_0_subsection_14_paragraphename','Dossier p├®dagogique'),(689,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_14_paragraphename','field_69c72efc6a921'),(690,42,'Builder_0_subsection_15_iframe','http:////v.calameo.com/?bkcode=006349639e07271fd46e7&language=fr&page=&showsharemenu=true&clickTo=public&clickTarget=_self&clickToUrl=&autoFlip=0&mode=mini&wmode=transparent'),(691,42,'_Builder_0_subsection_15_iframe','field_69c73cf3282d9'),(692,42,'_oembed_ebf33c6d78e87b8123a33f6b5f112fa5','{{unknown}}'),(693,40,'couleur_sombre','#b1a336'),(694,40,'_couleur_sombre','field_olthem_thm_couleur_sombre'),(695,40,'Builder_0_subsection_0_image','52'),(696,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_0_image','field_69cbb59ba2b3d'),(697,40,'Builder_0_subsection_0_imagescale','1'),(698,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_0_imagescale','field_69cbb647a2b3e'),(699,40,'Builder_0_subsection_0_xoffset','0'),(700,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_0_xoffset','field_69cbb685a2b3f'),(701,40,'Builder_0_subsection_0_yoffset','-150'),(702,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_0_yoffset','field_69cbb6b2a2b40'),(703,40,'Builder_0_subsection_0_alignbottom','0'),(704,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_0_alignbottom','field_69cbb95a00325'),(705,40,'Builder_0_subsection_0_aligntop','0'),(706,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_0_aligntop','field_69cbb98400326'),(707,40,'Builder_0_subsection_1_text','Souvent per├ºue comme un outil redoutable pour fa├ºonner les opinions et comportements, la propagande se faufile au coeur de nos soci├®t├®s. Elle est une ┬½ une tentative d├®lib├®r├®e et syst├®matique de fa├ºonner les perceptions, manipuler les capacit├®s cognitives et contr├┤ler le comportement de son r├®cepteur afin de sÔÇÖassurer une r├®ponse qui serve lÔÇÖintention souhait├®e par le propagandiste ┬╗\r\n\r\n(Debras, 2024).'),(708,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_1_text','field_69c4d54bbf536'),(709,40,'Builder_0_subsection_1_persotext','0'),(710,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_1_persotext','field_69c4d8e087a6b'),(711,40,'Builder_0_subsection_1_ignorespacing','0'),(712,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_1_ignorespacing','field_69cbeb348ce06'),(713,40,'Builder_0_subsection_2_paragraphename','Podcast avec Elio Acar'),(714,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_2_paragraphename','field_69c72efc6a921'),(715,40,'Builder_0_subsection_3_videolink','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w5lt0NI3tw0&t=11s'),(716,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_3_videolink','field_69c4cdb278524'),(717,40,'Builder_0_subsection_3_videotitle','Titre de la vid├®o'),(718,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_3_videotitle','field_69c4d22f9fcaa'),(719,40,'Builder_0_subsection_3_videotext','Texte d\'accompagnement de la vid├®o'),(720,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_3_videotext','field_69c4d26e9fcab'),(721,40,'Builder_0_subsection_3_displayvideotitle','0'),(722,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_3_displayvideotitle','field_69c4d2a89fcac'),(723,40,'Builder_0_subsection_3_displayvideotext','0'),(724,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_3_displayvideotext','field_69c4d2c99fcad'),(725,40,'Builder_0_subsection_4_paragraphename','La journ├®e ├®v├¿nement'),(726,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_4_paragraphename','field_69c72efc6a921'),(727,40,'Builder_0_subsection_5_text','La journ├®e ┬½┬áPropagande et information┬á┬╗, sÔÇÖest d├®roul├®e le 23 avril de mani├¿re enrichissante et interactive. Elle a d├®but├® par une table ronde avec Fran├ºois Debras, politique et Jehanne Berg├®, journaliste sous la mod├®ration de Nicolas Sohy. Apr├¿s une courte pause, les participants se sont r├®partis en quatre groupes pour participer ├á divers ateliers.\r\n\r\nAction m├®dias jeunes a propos├® son atelier ┬½┬áPropaganda &amp;Politica┬á┬╗, le Mundaneum un atelier intitul├® ┬½┬áDe lÔÇÖaffiche aux r├®seaux sociaux┬á┬╗, explorant lÔÇÖ├®volution des supports de propagande. Un autre atelier dirig├® par Rino Noviello a examin├® les liens entre intelligence artificielle et propagande et le Club de la Presse proposait un atelier pratique ┬½┬áPropagande et m├®dias┬á┬╗.\r\n\r\nLa journ├®e sÔÇÖest cl├┤tur├®e par un moment de synth├¿se et de partage des r├®flexions. Cette journ├®e a permis aux participants de mieux comprendre les m├®canismes de la propagande et de r├®fl├®chir ├á leur r├┤le dans le paysage m├®diatique actuel.\r\n\r\nVoici une vid├®o r├®cap r├®alis├®e par notre ├®tudiant, Th├®o Van Hoof'),(728,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_5_text','field_69c4d54bbf536'),(729,40,'Builder_0_subsection_5_persotext','0'),(730,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_5_persotext','field_69c4d8e087a6b'),(731,40,'Builder_0_subsection_5_ignorespacing','0'),(732,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_5_ignorespacing','field_69cbeb348ce06'),(733,40,'Builder_0_subsection_6_videolink','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hVJ1Hx99am8'),(734,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_6_videolink','field_69c4cdb278524'),(735,40,'Builder_0_subsection_6_videotitle','Titre de la vid├®o'),(736,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_6_videotitle','field_69c4d22f9fcaa'),(737,40,'Builder_0_subsection_6_videotext','Texte d\'accompagnement de la vid├®o'),(738,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_6_videotext','field_69c4d26e9fcab'),(739,40,'Builder_0_subsection_6_displayvideotitle','0'),(740,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_6_displayvideotitle','field_69c4d2a89fcac'),(741,40,'Builder_0_subsection_6_displayvideotext','0'),(742,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_6_displayvideotext','field_69c4d2c99fcad'),(743,40,'Builder_0_subsection_7_paragraphename','Le cycle d\'ateliers'),(744,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_7_paragraphename','field_69c72efc6a921'),(745,40,'Builder_0_subsection_8_videolink','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B_nxKa82xvY'),(746,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_8_videolink','field_69c4cdb278524'),(747,40,'Builder_0_subsection_8_videotitle','Titre de la vid├®o'),(748,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_8_videotitle','field_69c4d22f9fcaa'),(749,40,'Builder_0_subsection_8_videotext','Texte d\'accompagnement de la vid├®o'),(750,40,'_Builder_0_subsection_8_videotext','field_69c4d26e9fcab'),(751,40,'Builder_0_subsection_8_displayvideotitle','0'),(752,40,'_Builder_0_subsectio